# Admin Panel Monitoring System (Live Ingestion Console & Dashboard)

Create a dedicated, modular admin interface to monitor real-time route learning, geocoding status, GPS packet flow, and discovered route variations. This panel will be modularly isolated to serve as the foundation of the admin side of the project.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Zero Commuter Impact**: All admin code will reside in a separate Next.js route `/admin` and independent API endpoints `/api/v1/admin/*`. The user-facing page remains fully decoupled and unaffected.
> - **In-Memory Logging**: To prevent disk I/O bottlenecks and avoid writing logs continuously to database tables, logs are kept in a circular buffer (in-memory) of the last 100 events.

