## Proposed Changes

### Backend Module (`apps/backend`)

#### [NEW] [adminMonitor.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/services/adminMonitor.ts)
- A singleton service (`AdminMonitorService`) keeping:
  - An array of the last 100 log items: `{ timestamp, type: 'VALIDATION' | 'SEEDER' | 'LEARNING' | 'ERROR', busId, regNo, status: 'duplicate' | 'accepted' | 'rejected', message }`.
  - Current state of tracked buses: registration number, coordinates, speed, heading, and last active timestamp.
  - Interface methods: `addLog(item)`, `getLogs()`, `updateBus(regNo, data)`.

#### [NEW] [admin.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/api/admin.ts)
- Express router mapping:
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/monitor/logs` -> Returns the circular buffer of live GPS logs.
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/monitor/buses` -> Returns active bus states tracked by the seeder/engine.
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/monitor/stats` -> Returns current DB stats (stop counts, routes, learned routes).

#### [MODIFY] [index.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/index.ts)
- Mount `/api/v1/admin` endpoints on the server.
- Hook into the main ingestion route to push basic stats to the `AdminMonitorService`.

#### [MODIFY] [RouteProgressEngine.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/modules/route-progress/service/RouteProgressEngine.ts)
- Hook into the validation success/fail blocks (lines 22, 30) to record logs in `AdminMonitorService` for active tracking buses.

#### [MODIFY] [routeSeeder.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/engine/routeSeeder.ts)
- Hook into the seeder processes (e.g. geocoding, halt approximation, route saving) to log actions to `AdminMonitorService` in real-time.

